{"id": "janitorial-workers-compensation-premium-fraud", "title": "Janitorial firms and their owner faced an $8.38 million restitution order", "seconds": 62.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "ea0ea253f83ff458", "words": 151, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Insurance premiums for workers depend on the payroll a company reports.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.45, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Why", "did", "the", "premiums", "change?"], "sub": "Janitorial payroll"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.57, 1.14, 1.34, 1.8, 2.19, 2.3, 2.4, 2.97, 3.08, 3.55]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Prosecutors compared the payroll reported to insurers with employment records.", "t0": 4.57, "t1": 9.13, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "conviction", "kicker": "San Francisco District Attorney", "text": "Investigation and conviction", "mark": "Investigation and conviction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.78, 1.21, 1.33, 1.87, 2.35, 2.51, 3.15, 3.34, 3.9]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The companies understated payroll to obtain lower premiums.", "t0": 9.25, "t1": 12.69, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Lower premiums"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.68, 1.29, 1.82, 1.96, 2.37, 2.67]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The District Attorney obtained asset-freeze orders and a receivership.", "t0": 12.81, "t1": 16.77, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "conviction", "kicker": "San Francisco District Attorney", "text": "Receivership", "mark": "Receivership"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.6, 1.06, 1.55, 2.37, 2.86, 3.08, 3.16]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The receiver monitored funds while the businesses continued paying workers.", "t0": 16.89, "t1": 21.14, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Employee payroll"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.64, 1.25, 1.69, 1.92, 2.01, 2.61, 3.18, 3.59]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Bank records led investigators to a new janitorial business called Heart and Soul.", "t0": 21.36, "t1": 26.21, "shot": "accounts", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "accounts", "layout": "table", "heading": "Heart & Soul", "context": "Expanded receivership", "rows": [{"label": "New accounts", "value": "August 2020"}, {"label": "Property claim", "value": "March 2021"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.77, 1.01, 1.79, 1.95, 2.04, 2.26, 3.01, 3.47, 3.81, 4.12, 4.35]}, {"scene": "order", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The District Attorney reported felony convictions for Gregori and her companies.", "t0": 26.43, "t1": 30.91, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "conviction", "kicker": "San Francisco District Attorney", "text": "Felony convictions", "mark": "Felony convictions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.59, 1.04, 1.49, 1.95, 2.63, 2.82, 3.43, 3.57, 3.72]}, {"scene": "order", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Gregori received a six-year split sentence.", "t0": 31.03, "t1": 33.67, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Split sentence"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.91, 0.99, 1.55, 1.93]}, {"scene": "order", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The court ordered the combined restitution shown here.", "t0": 33.79, "t1": 36.76, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$8,382,788.45", "label": "Combined restitution ordered"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.47, 0.79, 0.91, 1.45, 2.23, 2.59]}, {"scene": "order", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The order covered the State Compensation Insurance Fund and a private insurer.", "t0": 36.88, "t1": 41.36, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Two recipients", "heading": "The combined restitution order", "source": "conviction", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "State Compensation Insurance Fund", "value": "Public insurer"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Private insurer", "value": "Separate recipient"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.52, 0.84, 0.93, 1.26, 2.01, 2.58, 3.05, 3.27, 3.35, 3.79]}, {"scene": "order", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The state Insurance Commissioner also reported the restitution amount.", "t0": 41.48, "t1": 45.19, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "state", "kicker": "California Department of Insurance", "text": "State Insurance Commissioner", "mark": "State Insurance Commissioner"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 0.92, 1.5, 1.9, 2.35, 2.47, 3.23]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In fiscal 2022–23, some of the frozen assets paid the receiver.", "t0": 45.41, "t1": 50.01, "shot": "receiver", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "fees", "layout": "table", "heading": "Who received funds?", "context": "Fiscal 2022–23", "rows": [{"label": "Paid", "value": "Receiver"}, {"label": "Insurer receipts", "value": "Unverified"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.62, 0.93, 1.44, 1.54, 2.22, 2.43, 2.5, 2.59, 3.06, 3.56, 3.86, 3.97]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The next filing said distribution of the remaining assets was still contested.", "t0": 50.13, "t1": 54.38, "shot": "litigation", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "litigation", "kicker": "Remaining assets", "text": "Contested distribution", "mark": "distribution"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.42, 0.88, 1.12, 1.8, 1.89, 2.01, 2.5, 2.98, 3.15, 3.47]}, {"scene": "order", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The state fund’s share and actual collections remain unverified.", "t0": 54.6, "t1": 58.61, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["State Fund share", "Collections"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.49, 0.88, 1.35, 1.56, 1.94, 2.63, 3.08]}, {"scene": "order", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 58.73, "t1": 61.34, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The understated payroll", "order": "The sentence and restitution"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "number"}